            "rationale": "The block rule for borrow, hold and renew is decided in Tier 2 (Loans.borrow, Loans.renew, Holds.place) through Accounts.isBlocked. The standing and members views (Tier 3) only call Accounts.isBlocked, and the CLI only renders. The change also deletes the old CLI code that computed fines minus payments and compared it to 5.00m. That code decided the rule in Tier 4, and the deletion removes an existing violation. Nothing in Tier 3 or 4 re-derives the rule.",
